2. Model weights
   The released AnyView weights were initialized from the NVIDIA Cosmos-Predict2
   base model and are distributed for non-commercial use. As a derivative of the
   NVIDIA base model, the weights are additionally subject to the terms of the
   NVIDIA Open Model License; see THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.

3. AnyViewBench evaluation data
   - Annotations, camera poses, index/metadata files, and data generated by
     Toyota Research Institute (Kubric-4D, Kubric-5D, ParallelDomain-4D splits):
     Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0);
     see licenses/CC-BY-4.0.txt. Kubric-5D was generated with the Kubric
     simulator (Apache 2.0).
   - Per-source pixel folders carry the license of their source dataset, stated
     in each folder's SOURCE_LICENSE.txt: DROID (CC BY 4.0); Argoverse 2,
     Lyft Level 5, DDAD (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0; see licenses/CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0.txt);
     AssemblyHands (CC BY-NC 4.0).
   - Ego-Exo4D and Waymo Open Dataset splits come as pointer manifests without
     pixels; the underlying data remains governed by the original dataset terms.
     See docs/RESTRICTED_DATA.md.
